1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,940
My cat went missing.

2
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:01,220
I found

3
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:01,920
him that night.

4
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:02,660
It wasn't him.

5
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:03,600
I opened the front

6
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:04,440
door for a package,

7
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,200
and my orange

8
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,200
tabby was gone.

9
00:00:06,626 --> 00:00:06,876
I searched

10
00:00:06,876 --> 00:00:07,345
the whole neighborhood

11
00:00:07,345 --> 00:00:07,946
with treats.

12
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:08,900
At around eleven,

13
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:09,580
there he was,

14
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:10,860
on my back porch.

15
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,065
I scooped him up.

16
00:00:12,065 --> 00:00:12,665
He hissed at me.

17
00:00:12,665 --> 00:00:13,165
He wouldn't sleep

18
00:00:13,165 --> 00:00:13,985
on my bed.

19
00:00:13,985 --> 00:00:14,235
He just

20
00:00:14,235 --> 00:00:15,700
stared at the front door.

21
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:15,950
And the food

22
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:16,440
was disappearing

23
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:17,460
twice as fast.

24
00:00:17,881 --> 00:00:18,141
Then a neighbor

25
00:00:18,141 --> 00:00:18,761
two houses

26
00:00:18,761 --> 00:00:20,341
down posted online.

27
00:00:20,341 --> 00:00:20,661
Her orange

28
00:00:20,661 --> 00:00:21,541
tabby went missing.

29
00:00:21,541 --> 00:00:22,981
The same night.

30
00:00:22,981 --> 00:00:23,461
That's when my real

31
00:00:23,461 --> 00:00:24,301
cat crawled out

32
00:00:24,301 --> 00:00:25,501
of my box spring.

33
00:00:25,501 --> 00:00:26,421
Covered in dust.

34
00:00:26,887 --> 00:00:27,207
He'd been hiding

35
00:00:27,207 --> 00:00:28,027
inside the bed

36
00:00:28,027 --> 00:00:29,216
the whole time.

37
00:00:29,216 --> 00:00:29,466
Two cats.

38
00:00:29,466 --> 00:00:29,816
One bowl.

39
00:00:29,816 --> 00:00:30,516
Three days.

40
00:00:30,943 --> 00:00:31,463
I carried her cat

41
00:00:31,463 --> 00:00:32,403
home in a carrier.

42
00:00:32,403 --> 00:00:33,885
She laughed so hard.

43
00:00:33,885 --> 00:00:34,265
Now the whole

44
00:00:34,265 --> 00:00:35,545
neighborhood knows me as

45
00:00:35,545 --> 00:00:35,825
the one

46
00:00:35,825 --> 00:00:36,345
who took home

47
00:00:36,345 --> 00:00:37,185
the wrong cat.

